div.p:
I wish to clarify the agency of desire in determining culture.  To do so, I will specify desire in terms of, one, its origin, or more precisely, the condition of its reproduction (its

 impulse

), and, two, its trajectory.  To consider desire vis-à-vis structure and constraint, I will draw upon the two Jacques, Lacan and Derrida, vis-à-vis subversion and change, Homi Bhabha, and finally, by way of contrast, I will enlist (interpellate?) Althusser.
